<title>EGYPT: Watany Bank Q1 97 results.</title>
<headline>Watany Bank Q1 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results released at the end of the first quarter of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, comparative figures from the previous year in brackets):</p>
<p>Total deposits	    1,454,106,254 (1,084,610,324)</p>
<p>Total assets		2,138,873,970 (1,550,650,537)</p>
<p>Reserves			 63,107,513     (5,626,574)</p>
<p>Provisions		    114,070,539    (95,630,317)</p>
<p>Shareholders funds	  166,254,578   (150,571,081)</p>
<p>Distributable profits	20,182,929    (43,202,249)</p>
<p>(Full name Watany Bank of Egypt )</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
